WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.130
- Wait, so how old are your kids now?

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:02.963
What are they up to?

00:00:02.963 --> 00:00:04.110
- So, my kids-
- One of them

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:05.410
is my daughter's age.
- Yes!

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:07.210
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.
- Yes.

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:09.270
One of them is seven.

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:10.103
Izzy.

00:00:10.103 --> 00:00:13.270
The other one just turned 11.

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:17.140
And Izzy's in a little bit
of a lying phase right now,

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:19.020
which I don't know if
you're going through.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:20.160
- Oh.
- Just like-

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.540
- Does she say, "Oh
no, I was just faking?"

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:23.457
- Yes, yes!

00:00:23.457 --> 00:00:25.020
"I was just faking!"

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.250
She says, "Oh, just kidding,"

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.487
or "just faking" and I'm like,

00:00:27.487 --> 00:00:29.262
"No, you're clinically lying."

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:30.095
- Yeah.

00:00:30.095 --> 00:00:31.750
You're a pathological liar.
- It's different, yeah,

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:32.583
you're sick.

00:00:32.583 --> 00:00:34.260
This is a sickness.
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.750
But it'll be like, it'll be random stuff.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.060
- Dumb stuff.
- Dumb stuff!

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.527
- Yep.
- Like, I'll like,

00:00:39.527 --> 00:00:41.580
"You just went to the
bathroom and forgot to flush."

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:43.730
And she'll be like, "No."

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:46.090
And I'll be like, "I haven't
done anything that small

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:48.380
since I was four."
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:51.240
So, like, I know it's not me.

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:54.005
- It's you!
- Your sister's not home.

00:00:54.005 --> 00:00:56.350
(Kelly laughing)
Like, it's not your mom.

00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:58.630
So, like, it's you.
- Yeah.

00:00:58.630 --> 00:00:59.717
- And she'll be like,

00:00:59.717 --> 00:01:01.383
"I don't know what you're talking about."

00:01:01.383 --> 00:01:03.020
- Oh my gosh.
- And then I'll like,

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:04.210
I'll find a way to prove it.

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:06.430
And she'll go, "Just kidding."

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:07.720
- I hate that!

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:08.553
She'll go, "I was just faking."

00:01:08.553 --> 00:01:10.620
I'm like, "No, no, no, no."

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:11.670
It's just called "lying."

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:13.410
- Yes, yes, exactly.

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:14.787
- It's just hard sometimes I'm like,

00:01:14.787 --> 00:01:15.810
"How do you get 'em to stop?"

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:17.853
I don't know, if you
find out, phone a friend.

